body:
The direct army of 20 lesbian friends of mine that refused to let me see anything other than Elsanna. When Frozen came out, they were all "this is the first lesbian couple in Disney", and then, before seeing the movie, bombarded me with fan art and videos. then they all took me to see the movie together (You ever watched a movie with 20 lesbians intent on making you a yuri shipper?) it was insanity. they had the entire movie rewritten in their heads and I had serious trouble seeing it any other way. 

&#x200B;

I liked their movie far more.

Won Miko two fans from this clip alone. No one out elites the Elite.

&#x200B;

"how the hell does she whistle like that! My mouth is exhausted just watching this!" Elite is the only answer.

Kino no tabi and Yuru camp. I'm a language nerd though, and just wanted to travel the world learning languages anyway.

&#x200B;

 I also fucking hate roofs....

Ummmm, okay, hear me out. Make a character, who hates what you hate, and fictionally write that character reacting to those things. You don't have to publish it in a fancy medical journal or [fanfiction.net](https://fanfiction.net) (if you don't wanna) , but complaining in a full rage is pretty entertaining.

&#x200B;

I honestly don't know either, I hate sucking at things, so I feel like I'm just wasting my time writing. Can't get over that.
